<section class="section"><div class="wrap wrap-narrow"><span class="eyebrow">Photography</span><h1 class="h1">Real images. Original creators.</h1><p class="lede mt-2">These photographs come from Wikimedia Commons. They illustrate the catalogue and may show a different model, year or individual item. Request current photographs of the actual item before bidding.</p><p class="mt-2">Homepage imagery is resized and converted to WebP from the credited original. Copyright remains with each photographer; follow the source link for the applicable licence and original image.</p><div class="stack mt-3"><% photoCredits.forEach(photo => { %><article class="panel panel-pad"><h2 class="h4"><%= photo.title %></h2><p class="small mt-1"><%= photo.author %> · <%= photo.licence %></p><p class="xsmall muted mt-1"><%= photo.file %></p><a class="text-link mt-1" href="<%= photo.descriptionUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original photograph and licence ↗</a></article><% }); %></div></div></section>